  "body": "What changed:\n- The batch tier runs the debug suites of `camcraft-kernel` (`kernel` is in `BATCH_CRATES`). The release tier is unchanged. `SLOW_BINARIES` is unchanged.\n- `cargo xtask gate <tier>` takes `--only <step>` (repeatable). It runs only the steps whose name starts with the word, for example `kernel`.\n- `cargo xtask gate <tier>` takes `--failed gate-logs/<run>`. It runs only the steps that failed in that earlier run. The failure is read from each step log.\n- `--dry-run` shows the selected steps. An empty selection is an error that lists the step names. Both options are refused for `gate test`.\n- AGENTS.md (\"Three gate tiers\") states the change. The decision record is `docs/decisions/1702-gate-only-failed.md`.\n\nTests:\n- `cargo test -p xtask`: 127 passed.\n- New tests in `xtask/src/select_tests.rs`: `batch_runs_kernel_and_release_and_slow_list_are_unchanged`, `only_matches_a_whole_word_prefix`, `only_keeps_named_steps_and_refuses_an_empty_selection`, `failed_reads_the_logs_of_an_earlier_run`, `failed_dir_that_is_missing_is_an_error`, `gate_options_parse`.\n- `cargo xtask gate batch --dry-run` lists `kernel suites`. `--only kernel --dry-run` lists only that step.\n\nNot exercised: a real batch gate, and `--failed` on a real `gate-logs` directory (only the pure log reader is tested).\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1702\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
